  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/692/726/shieldexpansionexpansion_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1128\" height=\"293\"><span><strong>简介</strong></span><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span>Shield Expansion Expansion 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shield-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shield Expansion</a> 的扩展模组。它为每种材料等级添加了两种新类型的盾牌：普通<strong>盾牌</strong>和<strong>塔盾</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>塔盾</strong>是普通盾牌的加重版本。它们拥有<strong>更长的格挡窗口</strong>、<strong>更高的耐力消耗</strong>以及<strong>更高的爆炸抗性</strong>。<strong>盾牌</strong>则在格挡时具有<strong>更快的移动速度</strong>、<strong>更高的弹反伤害</strong>和<strong>更短的冷却时间</strong>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>本模组建议搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dixtas-armory\" rel=\"nofollow\">dixta's Armory</a> 一起游玩。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>推荐模组</strong><span><br></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shield-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Shield Expansion</ins></a> - 必需</span></strong></span><span><strong><span><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dixtas-armory\" rel=\"nofollow\">dixta's Armory</a>&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp; </span></strong><span>为游戏添加了许多新武器。</span><strong><span><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/model-gap-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Model Gap Fix</ins></a> - </span></strong><span>修复物品中出现的微小间隙。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><strong>兼容模组</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><ins></ins><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dixtas-armory\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>dixta's Armory</ins></a> - </strong>完全兼容<br></span><span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Oreganized</ins></a> - </strong>开发中兼容性<strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Enlightend</ins></a> - </strong>开发中兼容性<strong><br><ins>Caverns &amp; Chasms</ins> - </strong>计划兼容<strong><br><ins></ins><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/undead-unleashed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Undead Unleashed!</ins> </a>- </strong>计划兼容</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span><strong>常见问题解答</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span><strong>这个模组会移植到其他版本吗？</strong></span><br><span>是的，我计划将该模组移植到 1.19.2 及任何后续流行的版本。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>这个模组适用于哪种模组加载器？</strong></span><br><span>目前仅提供 Forge 版本。取决于模组的受欢迎程度，我可能会考虑将其移植到 Fabric。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>我可以将此模组用于我的整合包吗？</strong></span><br><span>当然可以！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>支持我</h4>\n<p>如果你喜欢我的模组并希望帮助我添加更多内容，欢迎查看我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=55298160\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span><strong>社交媒体</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span>如果您有任何想要报告的漏洞、建议、问题，或者只是想聊聊天，欢迎加入我的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5zsPnU44qQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
